-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §11: an existing teaching employee in a
-- school the reform has not reached stays under every agreement,
-- arrangement and practice in force on the eve of the signing, as updated
-- from time to time ("ההסכמים הקיימים").

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `11`

DECLARE `terms of employment` IS ONE OF `the reform's terms`, `the existing agreements`

@ref akn:art_11
GIVEN `an existing teaching employee` IS A BOOLEAN, `the reform applied in the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `terms of employment`
DECIDE `the terms section 11 keeps` `an existing teaching employee` `the reform applied in the school` IS
    IF `an existing teaching employee` AND NOT `the reform applied in the school`
    THEN JUST `the existing agreements`
    ELSE NOTHING

#ASSERT `the terms section 11 keeps` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the existing agreements`
#ASSERT isNothing (`the terms section 11 keeps` TRUE TRUE)
